<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all five auctions whereby it had sought to drain 2.431 billion pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    500 million    20 days   22.69 pct</p>
<p>    500 million    19 days   22.64 pct</p>
<p>    500 million    14 days   22.57 pct</p>
<p>    500 million    13 days   22.54 pct</p>
<p>    431 million     5 days   22.85 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
